    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d331">

                <pb facs="0478" n="386" xml:id="pg386"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/11849</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-23T16:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 23, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 24, 9.10
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2212. My 2210.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d331-f1"/> Offensive which starts today is
                    undertaken in consequence of pressure brought to bear on commanding general from
                    outside and for common good and I believe contrary to his military opinion. I
                    hope therefore that, should it not succeed, troops will be sent here immediately
                    as otherwise consequences may be serious.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
